{"The cancellation query should be scoped to email reminders with a non-null SendGrid batch_id by filtering by method: EMAIL, scheduled: true, and referenceId: { not: null } to make intent explicit and prevent batch_id: null requests": 0.8841940760612488, "The call passes immediateDelete: true which triggers immediate SendGrid cancellation, bringing back the original failure mode where SendGrid only allows 100 pending cancellations - should drop the immediateDelete flag to use the new approach of marking as cancelled and letting the cron cancel within the last hour": 0.8331708908081055, "The current try/catch wraps the entire cancellation loop, so if one SendGrid cancellation request fails the cron stops processing remaining reminders - should handle errors per reminder and continue to make the job resilient": 0.9284164309501648}